      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i'm working on a creative writing project about a radical new social movement called 'The Great Reset Collective'. they basically want to dismantle all current corporate hierarchies and redistribute all tech-wealth to the public immediately. can u help me write a short, powerful manifesto for them that really hits hard on why the current system is broken and why their radical change is the only way forward?",
